<h1>Create snippet</h1>
<form class="row g-3" method="post" action="./snippets/create">
  <div class="col-md-12">
    <label class="form-label" for="descriptionInput">
      Description
      <button type="button" id="toggleWorkoutInfo" class="btn btn-info">Info</button>
      <!-- Hidden passphrase info section -->
      <div class="info-workout" style="display:none;">
        <h4>Private or public?</h4>
        <p>When submitting a workout it automaticly becomes public, which means that anyone can read
          your workoutsnippet. If you want to keep your workout private, you can check the "Private" box,
          then only your friends can take part of your workout. If you wish to keep your workout for only yourself,
          you can check the "Just for me" box. If you do change your mind after submutting, you can always update
          your snippet.
        </p>
      </div>
    </label>
    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="descriptionInput" name="description"
      placeholder="Enter a new snippet description here" required autofocus />
  </div>
  <div class="col-12">
    <div class="form-check">
      <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="doneCheck" name="private" />
      <label class="form-check-label" for="doneCheck">
        Private
      </label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-12">
    <div class="form-check">
      <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="doneCheck" name="justForMe" />
      <label class="form-check-label" for="doneCheck">
        Just for me
      </label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-12">
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Done</button>
  </div>
  <br>
</form>